   "lines": [
    "Went in to New",
    "York, where I pass",
    "the night. Call[?] on",
    "poor Cousin [illegible]; he is",
    "dying by inches.",
    "Cousin Sam Roose-",
    "-velt is dead; it",
    "is terrible for his",
    "poor daughters. I",
    "have been feeling",
    "very sad about",
    "dear old Hal",
    "Minot.",
    "In the evening Jack",
    "Roosevelt, Emlen & I",
    "had a very pleasant",
    "dinner at the Union",
    "League Club."
   ],
